います。\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_Uawa/works/18", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b813d3cd/uploads/origins/d0d9363b-176e-48c9-8aea-64696c552672?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b5ee1b2c20e919476086655cc5ef038", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b813d3cd/uploads/origins/d0d9363b-176e-48c9-8aea-64696c552672?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b5ee1b2c20e919476086655cc5ef038, https://si.imgix.net/b813d3cd/uploads/origins/d0d9363b-176e-48c9-8aea-64696c552672?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bfae24b02312c24420013cfd7b2ed085 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b813d3cd/uploads/origins/d0d9363b-176e-48c9-8aea-64696c552672?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99d0911c01cd9000d807a55c79342135 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I would like to request this character: https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=10GZrpr10ppXdptX3EowoGzZ0e1s19GjC\n\nできれば、カジュアルなワンピースに可愛い帽子をかぶった姿をお願いします。その他の部分はお任せします。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/folderview?id=10GZrpr10ppXdptX3EowoGzZ0e1s19GjC", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_Uawa/works/17", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5d8db38b/uploads/origins/4586ab65-cfb0-49af-b60d-f0c3bdb15132?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55982a755cb49b2c682cd1c01af97c21", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5d8db38b/uploads/origins/4586ab65-cfb0-49af-b60d-f0c3bdb15132?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55982a755cb49b2c682cd1c01af97c21, https://si.imgix.net/5d8db38b/uploads/origins/4586ab65-cfb0-49af-b60d-f0c3bdb15132?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4f8c53a5e7ec9c14ef40c3311